{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "displayName": "status daily",
      "name": "platform_health__status_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `status`, MEASURE(`dataset_runs`) AS `dataset_runs`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_run_status`\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `status`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `status`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "errors daily",
      "name": "platform_health__errors_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `error_class`, MEASURE(`errors`) AS `errors`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_errors`\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `error_class`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `error_class`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "not succeeded",
      "name": "platform_health__not_succeeded",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `status`, `message`, `origin`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_dataset_runs`\n",
        "WHERE `status` IN ('failed', 'skipped')\n",
        "ORDER BY `day` DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "alerts",
      "name": "platform_health__alerts",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `rule`, `subject`, `kind`, `channel`, `to`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_alerts`\n",
        "ORDER BY `at` DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "alert counts",
      "name": "platform_health__alert_counts",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `rule`, MEASURE(`alerts`) AS `alerts`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_alerts`\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `rule`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `rule`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "severity daily",
      "name": "platform_health__severity_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `owner`, `severity`, MEASURE(`steps`) AS `steps`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_steps`\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `owner`, `severity`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `owner`, `severity`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "steps not passed",
      "name": "platform_health__steps_not_passed",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `owner`, `step`, `severity`, `message`, `screen`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_steps`\n",
        "WHERE `passed` = FALSE\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "displayName": "Platform health",
      "layout": [
        {
          "position": {
            "height": 2,
            "width": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Platform health\n",
                "\n",
                "Did the loads run, and did they succeed? Runs per day by outcome, errors by class, what failed, the alerts that went out, and each owner's step results by severity (the detail is on the owner's screen). Job-level runs, their count and run time are the platform's own job monitoring screen (adopted, not rebuilt): this screen starts below the job, at the dataset.\n",
                "\n",
                "Owned by observability. Built from the ops metric views over the compact ops tables (run log, daily telemetry copy, freshness, alerts), joined by run id. Discharges DPC-0057, OPS-03, OPS-01, OPS-06."
              ]
            },
            "name": "about"
          }
        },
